      "summary": "Avocado Toast With Caramelized Sweet Onion, Grape Tomatoes, Fresh Garden Chives and Chive Blossoms takes roughly <b>45 minutes</b> from beginning to end. One portion of this dish contains around <b>6g of protein</b>, <b>23g of fat</b>, and a total of <b>318 calories</b>. This recipe serves 2 and costs $2.57 per serving. If you have ground pepper, onion, chive blossoms, and a few other ingredients on hand, you can make it. 16 people have tried and liked this recipe. It is brought to you by Foodista. It is a good option if you're following a <b>dairy free, lacto ovo vegetarian, and vegan</b> diet. All things considered, we decided this recipe <b>deserves a spoonacular score of 62%</b>. This score is good. If you like this recipe, you might also like recipes such as <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/avocado-toast-with-caramelized-sweet-onion-grape-tomatoes-fresh-garden-chives-and-chive-blossoms-1408961\">Avocado Toast With Caramelized Sweet Onion, Grape Tomatoes, Fresh Garden Chives and Chive Blossoms</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/avocado-toast-with-caramelized-sweet-onion-grape-tomatoes-fresh-garden-chives-and-chive-blossoms-1405595\">Avocado Toast With Caramelized Sweet Onion, Grape Tomatoes, Fresh Garden Chives and Chive Blossoms</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/avocado-toast-with-caramelized-sweet-onion-grape-tomatoes-fresh-garden-chives-and-chive-blossoms-1467061\">Avocado Toast With Caramelized Sweet Onion, Grape Tomatoes, Fresh Garden Chives and Chive Blossoms</a>.",
