      "summary": "Beef With Oranges and Spices takes roughly <b>45 minutes</b> from beginning to end. For <b>$6.37 per serving</b>, you get a main course that serves 4. One serving contains <b>411 calories</b>, <b>32g of protein</b>, and <b>29g of fat</b>. 4 people were glad they tried this recipe. This recipe from Foodista requires olive oil, beef, garlic, and cumin. It is a good option if you're following a <b>gluten free, dairy free, whole 30, and ketogenic</b> diet. All things considered, we decided this recipe <b>deserves a spoonacular score of 65%</b>. This score is good. Similar recipes are <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/beef-curry-with-toasted-spices-221972\">Beef Curry with Toasted Spices</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/seared-beef-and-oranges-with-arugula-8478\">Seared Beef And Oranges With Arugula</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/beef-tenderloin-with-aromatic-thai-spices-81763\">Beef Tenderloin with Aromatic Thai Spices</a>.",
