      "summary": "Baked Banana Pudding With Rum Sauce is a <b>lacto ovo vegetarian</b> dessert. One portion of this dish contains about <b>30g of protein</b>, <b>131g of fat</b>, and a total of <b>2628 calories</b>. For <b>$7.16 per serving</b>, this recipe <b>covers 52%</b> of your daily requirements of vitamins and minerals. This recipe serves 1. 2 people were glad they tried this recipe. A mixture of brown sugar, water, butter to grease moulds, and a handful of other ingredients are all it takes to make this recipe so delicious. From preparation to the plate, this recipe takes approximately <b>45 minutes</b>. It is brought to you by Foodista. Overall, this recipe earns a <b>solid spoonacular score of 76%</b>. Users who liked this recipe also liked <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/bread-pudding-with-banana-rum-sauce-554252\">Bread Pudding with Banana Rum Sauce</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/banana-rum-cheesecake-with-maple-rum-sauce-598853\">Banana Rum Cheesecake with Maple Rum Sauce</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/banana-butter-rum-pudding-49314\">Banana Butter Rum Pudding</a>.",
