          "pairingText": "Crab works really well with Chardonnay, Riesling, and Pinot Grigio. Chilled crab tastes great with pinot grigio. Warm crab (especially with butter) can be matched with a buttery Chardonnay or a crisp fruity Riesling. The Bien Nacido Estate Chardonnay with a 4.9 out of 5 star rating seems like a good match. It costs about 53 dollars per bottle.",
