          "pairingText": "Spring Rolls can be paired with Sparkling Wine and Sparkling rosé. If you're serving a selection of appetizers, you can't go wrong with these. Both are very food friendly and complement a variety of flavors. One wine you could try is Veuve Clicquot Yellow Label Brut with Isothermic Gift Bag. It has 4.9 out of 5 stars and a bottle costs about 70 dollars.",
