      "summary": "Garlic Lemon Pepper Shrimp Salad (Clean Eating) requires roughly <b>20 minutes</b> from start to finish. Watching your figure? This gluten free, dairy free, paleolithic, and primal recipe has <b>272 calories</b>, <b>21g of protein</b>, and <b>15g of fat</b> per serving. For <b>$3.97 per serving</b>, this recipe <b>covers 20%</b> of your daily requirements of vitamins and minerals. This recipe serves 1. This recipe is liked by 3 foodies and cooks. Head to the store and pick up greens, lemon, green onion, and a few other things to make it today. Only a few people really liked this main course. It is brought to you by Pink When. With a spoonacular <b>score of 82%</b>, this dish is outstanding. If you like this recipe, take a look at these similar recipes: <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/garlic-lemon-pepper-shrimp-salad-clean-eating-1324367\">Garlic Lemon Pepper Shrimp Salad (Clean Eating)</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/clean-eating-garlic-lemon-vinaigrette-1024998\">Clean Eating Garlic Lemon Vinaigrette</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/clean-eating-garlic-shrimp-with-black-bean-noodles-626270\">Clean Eating Garlic Shrimp with Black Bean Noodles</a>.",
