      "summary": "The recipe South Carolina Style Pulled Pork is ready <b>in roughly 45 minutes</b> and is definitely an amazing <b>gluten free and dairy free</b> option for lovers of American food. One serving contains <b>692 calories</b>, <b>48g of protein</b>, and <b>21g of fat</b>. This recipe serves 10. For <b>$3.19 per serving</b>, this recipe <b>covers 36%</b> of your daily requirements of vitamins and minerals. 3 people were glad they tried this recipe. Not a lot of people really liked this main course. If you have apple cider vinegar, ground cumin, garlic, and a few other ingredients on hand, you can make it. It is brought to you by Foodista. With a spoonacular <b>score of 81%</b>, this dish is awesome. If you like this recipe, you might also like recipes such as <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/north-carolina-style-pulled-pork-458007\">North Carolina-Style Pulled Pork</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/carolina-style-pulled-pork-sliders-1344539\">Carolina Style Pulled Pork Sliders</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/carolina-style-pulled-pork-sandwiches-714634\">Carolina-Style Pulled Pork Sandwiches</a>.",
