          "pairingText": "Pinot Noir, Malbec, and Zinfandel are my top picks for Sloppy Joe. All these red wines pair well with a sloppy joe's ground beef and tomato sauce. The Flowers Sea View Ridge Estate Pinot Noir with a 4.6 out of 5 star rating seems like a good match. It costs about 67 dollars per bottle.",
