      "summary": "A Refreshing Drink To Welcome You All is a beverage that serves 6. One serving contains <b>43 calories</b>, <b>2g of protein</b>, and <b>0g of fat</b>. For <b>88 cents per serving</b>, this recipe <b>covers 7%</b> of your daily requirements of vitamins and minerals. It is a good option if you're following a <b>gluten free, dairy free, lacto ovo vegetarian, and fodmap friendly</b> diet. 3 people have made this recipe and would make it again. From preparation to the plate, this recipe takes roughly <b>45 minutes</b>. This recipe from Foodista requires mint leaves, lemons, kg of sugar, and water. All things considered, we decided this recipe <b>deserves a spoonacular score of 83%</b>. This score is awesome. Similar recipes are <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/refreshing-rum-drink-148666\">Refreshing Rum Drink</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/refreshing-lemon-lime-drink-425170\">Refreshing Lemon-Lime Drink</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/refreshing-chia-fresca-isikiate-drink-1761375\">Refreshing Chia Fresca (Isikiate) Drink</a>.",
