      "summary": "Pink Grapefruit Slaw is a <b>gluten free, dairy free, and lacto ovo vegetarian</b> side dish. This recipe makes 4 servings with <b>90 calories</b>, <b>2g of protein</b>, and <b>3g of fat</b> each. For <b>51 cents per serving</b>, this recipe <b>covers 9%</b> of your daily requirements of vitamins and minerals. This recipe from Foodista requires salt or, onion, cabbage, and mayonnaise. <b>The Fourth Of July</b> will be even more special with this recipe. Only a few people made this recipe, and 3 would say it hit the spot. From preparation to the plate, this recipe takes around <b>45 minutes</b>. All things considered, we decided this recipe <b>deserves a spoonacular score of 61%</b>. This score is solid. Users who liked this recipe also liked <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/pink-grapefruit-cupcakes-with-pink-grapefruit-cream-cheese-frosting-547616\">Pink Grapefruit Cupcakes with Pink Grapefruit Cream Cheese Frosting</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/pink-grapefruit-margaritas-330016\">Pink Grapefruit Margaritas</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/pink-grapefruit-sorbet-334317\">Pink Grapefruit Sorbet</a>.",
