      "instructions": "<ol><li>In small bowl or measuring cup, combine mayonnaise, 3 tablespoons fresh grapefruit juice (from just a segment or two), sugar, 1 tsp grapefruit zest, salt, and pepper; whisk to blend.  </li><li>In large bowl, combine  cabbage, grapefruit sections from what is left of the grapefruit, and onion; dressing and toss to coat.  Garnish with parsley, if desired,  and serve immediately.</li></ol>",
