      "summary": "Need a <b>gluten free, dairy free, paleolithic, and lacto ovo vegetarian breakfast</b>? Banana Blueberry Pancakes could be an excellent recipe to try. One portion of this dish contains approximately <b>4g of protein</b>, <b>10g of fat</b>, and a total of <b>174 calories</b>. For <b>56 cents per serving</b>, this recipe <b>covers 6%</b> of your daily requirements of vitamins and minerals. This recipe serves 8. 3 people were glad they tried this recipe. From preparation to the plate, this recipe takes roughly <b>45 minutes</b>. It is brought to you by Foodista. If you have cream of tartar, water, blueberries, and a few other ingredients on hand, you can make it. With a spoonacular <b>score of 20%</b>, this dish is not so amazing. Try <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/blueberry-banana-pancakes-446357\">blueberry banana pancakes</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/banana-blueberry-pancakes-1404959\">Banana Blueberry Pancakes</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/banana-blueberry-pancakes-401560\">Banana Blueberry Pancakes</a> for similar recipes.",
