      "summary": "Coconut-Almond Crusted Tilapia requires approximately <b>45 minutes</b> from start to finish. One serving contains <b>379 calories</b>, <b>39g of protein</b>, and <b>23g of fat</b>. This recipe serves 4 and costs $3.93 per serving. 15 people were glad they tried this recipe. This recipe from Foodista requires tilapia, pepper, coconut milk, and salt. It works well as a main course. It is a good option if you're following a <b>gluten free, dairy free, paleolithic, and primal</b> diet. With a spoonacular <b>score of 78%</b>, this dish is solid. Try <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/coconut-almond-crusted-tilapia-1375103\">Coconut Almond Crusted Tilapia</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/coconut-almond-crusted-tilapia-6728\">Coconut Almond Crusted Tilapia</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/coconut-almond-crusted-tilapia-1622679\">Coconut-Almond Crusted Tilapia</a> for similar recipes.",
