      "summary": "Need a <b>dairy free and lacto ovo vegetarian side dish</b>? Montreal style bagels could be a tremendous recipe to try. This recipe makes 12 servings with <b>278 calories</b>, <b>6g of protein</b>, and <b>6g of fat</b> each. For <b>40 cents per serving</b>, this recipe <b>covers 9%</b> of your daily requirements of vitamins and minerals. 4 people were impressed by this recipe. It is brought to you by Foodista. Head to the store and pick up active yeast, maple syrup, sunflower oil, and a few other things to make it today. From preparation to the plate, this recipe takes approximately <b>45 minutes</b>. Overall, this recipe earns a <b>solid spoonacular score of 58%</b>. Users who liked this recipe also liked <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/montreal-style-bagels-1432591\">Montreal style bagels</a>, <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/montreal-bagels-79949\">Montreal Bagels</a>, and <a href=\"https://spoonacular.com/recipes/montreal-bagels-698160\">Montreal Bagels</a>.",
